      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Kim SY, Huh KH, Roh YH, Oh YJ, Park J, Choi YS. Nefopam as an adjunct to intravenous patient-controlled analgesia after renal transplantation: a randomised trial. Acta Anaesthesiologica Scandinavica, 59(8), 1068-1075. DOI: 10.1111/aas.12519. In the article \"Nefopam as an adjunct to intravenous patient-controlled analgesia after renal transplantation: a randomised trial\", the published title of vertical axis B in Figure 2 which is 'Pain at rest' was incorrect. The correct title of the vertical axis B is 'Pain on coughing.' The correct figure 2 has been reproduced here for clarity. We apologize for any inconvenience caused."},
